What changed between two published Players Committee images of [[They're Tracking Us (V)]]: left, the image of [[They're Tracking Us (V)]] (holotable commit 022435b); right, the image of [[They're Tracking Us (V) (Errata)]] (holotable commit 30816d1). Both crops are cut from the published images ([https://github.com/swccgpc/holotable/blob/022435b7929e4de26dafbcb1de2ec1d6d04d2153/Images-HT/starwars/Virtual7-Light/large/theyretrackingus.gif before], [https://github.com/swccgpc/holotable/blob/30816d1eceffdd0a07a5af277fcbcbc9fc96f665/Images-HT/starwars/Virtual7-Light/large/theyretrackingus.gif after]) with their pixels unchanged; only the white label strip is added.